# What never leaves this machine.
#
# Vercel uploads the working directory, so anything sensitive or irrelevant is
# excluded explicitly rather than relying on .gitignore being honoured.
#
# EVERY DIRECTORY PATTERN IS ANCHORED WITH A LEADING SLASH. These are
# gitignore-style patterns, so an unanchored `supabase/` matches at any depth —
# which also excluded `lib/supabase/`, removed the database client from the upload,
# and failed the build with module-not-found across every route that imports it.
/.secrets/
/.env
/.env.*
/.vercel/

# Not needed to build or run the app.
/tests/
/reference/
/docs/
/.github/
/playwright-report/
/test-results/
/supabase/

# Local tooling
/.claude/
/.remember/
